.Dd October 4, 2026
.Dt RELEASE-CHECKSUM 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm release-checksum
.Nd update an aport's pkgver and sha512sums from a pushed upstream tag
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Ar pkgname
.Ar tag
.Op Fl -commit
.Op Fl -push
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
automates the tag-tarball checksum dance.  It fetches the source tarball for
.Ar tag
from
.Lk https://github.com/moebiusV/ Ns Ar pkgname ,
computes its sha512, and rewrites
.Pa testing/ Ns Ar pkgname Ns Pa /APKBUILD
so that
.Va pkgver
and
.Va sha512sums
match the new release.
.Pp
The APKBUILD rewrite is done by
.Xr apkbuild_bump 1 ,
a small Ada program, so the fragile part \(em the
.Va pkgver
line and the single- or multi-line
.Va sha512sums
block \(em is validated rather than done with sed.
.Nm
itself does the network fetch, the hashing, the build of that helper, and the
git steps.
.Pp
By default
.Nm
only prints the resulting
.Xr git 1
diff; nothing is committed.
.Sh OPTIONS
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Fl -commit
Stage and commit the APKBUILD change to the overlay's main branch.
.It Fl -push
Push main after committing.
.El
.Sh EXAMPLES
Review the bump for mustache-ada 0.3.0 without committing:
.Bd -literal -offset indent
$ ./tools/release-checksum.sh mustache-ada v0.3.0
.Ed
.Pp
Commit and push the bump:
.Bd -literal -offset indent
$ ./tools/release-checksum.sh mustache-ada v0.3.0 --commit --push
.Ed
.Sh FILES
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Pa tools/apkbuild_bump
The Ada program that performs the APKBUILD rewrite.
.It Pa tools/apkbuild_bump.gpr
Its build project.
.El
.Sh ENVIRONMENT
.Nm
requires
.Xr curl 1 ,
.Xr sha512sum 1 ,
.Xr git 1 ,
and
.Xr gprbuild 1
(or a prebuilt
.Pa tools/apkbuild_bump ) .
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr apkbuild_bump 1
.Sh AUTHORS
.Nm
and
.Xr apkbuild_bump 1
were written for the
.Lk https://github.com/moebiusV/ada-on-alpine ada-on-alpine
overlay.
